  "name": "King Cake in a Bread Machine",
  "subtitle": "A cinnamon-pecan ring with colorful sugar topping",
  "description": "Use the bread machine to mix and rise the dough, then shape it around a cinnamon-pecan filling, bake, glaze, and finish with colored sugars.",
